Description: Depth: Tell the engine while a window's elements show depth
 .
 Whoever draws a window once per eye, the edition's Qt Widgets and Qt Quick,
 needs to know when to: while the platform says the window is awake on a
 stereo output and the limits are not all zero. Both outputs now keep the
 window's _q_stereo_depth to that, so the engine draws one picture, as on a
 2D output, whenever it is false.
