+/*!
+ * The name of the dynamic property of a QWindow, a bool, that is true while its
+ * elements are shown in depth: the platform says the window is awake on a
+ * stereo output and the limits are not all zero. Whoever draws windows once per
+ * eye (the edition's Qt Widgets and Qt Quick) does so only while it is true,
+ * and hands the pair over as the desktop's own depth; otherwise the window is
+ * drawn once, as on a 2D output.
+ */
+inline constexpr char DepthProperty[] = "_q_stereo_depth";
 /*!
  * The name of the dynamic property of a QWindow that says which eye is being
